    "company": "Enterprise Case",
    "context": "A logistics startup has a proprietary routing algorithm (Valuable) that is unique in the market (Rare). Competitors are unable to copy it because it is based on a complex mathematical theorem developed by the founders (Inimitable). However, due to bad management, the startup fails to build a sales team or integrate the software into customer workflows. Under VRIO, what is the status of their resource?",
