    "track": "gen-man",
    "sector": "Corporate Strategy",
    "company": "Enterprise Case",
    "context": "A software-as-a-service company gets 100,000 unique website visitors per month (Awareness). However, only 50 people sign up for a free trial (Interest/Desire). In funnel terms, this represents a conversion leak between:",
    "prompt": "What is the best strategic recommendation for this scenario?",
