    "title": "LEAN STARTUP BUILD MEASURE LEARN",
    "track": "tech-pm",
    "sector": "Corporate Strategy",
    "company": "Enterprise Case",
    "context": "Dropbox launched a 3-minute video showing how its file synchronization software worked before the software was actually built. This validated customer interest by causing signups to jump from 5,000 to 75,000. In Lean Startup terms, this video was a:",
