    "title": "PORTERS FIVE FORCES",
    "track": "fmcg-brand",
    "sector": "Corporate Strategy",
    "company": "Enterprise Case",
    "context": "A restaurant chain owner notices that local grocery stores have started offering premium, hot, ready-to-eat meals at a cheaper price point, hurting her lunchtime sales. In Porter's Five Forces, these grocery offerings are:",
