    "id": 100,
    "title": "VRIO FRAMEWORK",
    "track": "gen-man",
    "sector": "Corporate Strategy",
    "company": "Enterprise Case",
    "context": "A boutique hotel has a beautiful view of a historic monument that cannot be built over. Competitors cannot replicate this view because of geographic location. Under VRIO, this source of inimitability is:",
