    "context": "In the video streaming industry, content creators (directors, actors) are unionizing and demanding higher residuals (Supplier Power). Meanwhile, consumers can switch between Netflix, Disney+, and Max instantly with zero exit fees (Buyer Power).",
    "prompt": "What structural recommendation would insulate a streaming provider from these margin pressures?",
