    "context": "A delivery giant spent $500M developing a proprietary dispatching algorithm (Valuable) that reduces delivery routes by 10 million miles annually. Competitors cannot replicate it because it relies on 20 years of proprietary traffic telemetry data (Rare/Inimitable). The firm has fully integrated this software across all fleet vehicles.",
