    "company": "Enterprise Case",
    "context": "A mobile mechanic startup launches an app offering car servicing at customers' homes. They invest in high-end tools (Physical Evidence) and set premium rates (Price). However, mechanics show up late, leave grease stains on driveways, and do not explain the service completed.",
    "prompt": "In the 7Ps, which two service marketing elements are failing to support the premium brand?",
