        "frameworkUtilization": "How to read it. How to read it. The schematic is three concentric circles: TAM outermost, SAM inside it, SOM at the core, each labelled with its definition and its typical estimation route. Annotate the rings with the filters that shrink each level (product scope, geography, channel → competition, capacity, time). In class, attach real numbers from a case and show the shrinkage ratios — students are consistently surprised how small credible SOM is relative to headline TAM.",
