        "boundaryTrap": "**Boundary Trap & Novice Anti-Pattern**: • As proof of venture quality — a big TAM says nothing about the team's ability to capture any of it\n• For category-creating products sized off existing spend — behaviour-based sizing is required, or the estimate is meaningless\n• When only a top-down number is quoted — without a bottom-up reconciliation the figure is a citation, not an analysis\n• In fast-changing markets treated statically — TAM in year five, not today, is the decision-relevant number",
