    "sector": "Corporate Strategy",
    "company": "Enterprise Case",
    "context": "A traditional school has a strong local brand and physical classrooms (Strength) but lacks online teaching infrastructure (Weakness). During a pandemic lock-down (Threat), they partner with Zoom to launch a virtual academy.",
    "prompt": "In a TOWS matrix, this zoom partnership represents a:",
