    "context": "A retail bank updates its mobile app. Customers complain that the biometric login fails 25% of the time, forcing them to manually type passwords. However, when biometric login works perfectly, customer reviews are indifferent, treating it as standard.",
    "prompt": "Under the Kano Model, how should the product manager classify biometric login?",
