        "frameworkUtilization": "How to read it. How to read it. The schematic overlays two curves: the bell curve of adopter categories (with the five segments labelled and percentaged) and the cumulative S-curve rising through it to saturation. Beneath, list the five perceived attributes as levers. Teach the relationship between the curves — the S-curve is the bell curve's integral — and have students mark where a chosen product currently sits on both.",
