        "boundaryTrap": "**Boundary Trap & Novice Anti-Pattern**: • In early-stage technology categories where baseline must-have utility is still undefined\n• When capital constraints prevent building distribution scale to protect first-mover advantages\n• In pure commodity markets where government regulation dictates rigid pricing",
