    "sector": "Corporate Strategy",
    "company": "Enterprise Case",
    "context": "A video rental chain sees sales decline by 30% year-over-year. They decide to close 80% of stores, stop buying new movie inventory, and run the remaining stores with minimal staff to milk cash.",
