    "sector": "Corporate Strategy",
    "company": "Enterprise Case",
    "context": "A hotel chain starts giving guests a warm chocolate chip cookie at check-in. Guests write positive social media reviews about the cookie. When the cookie is unavailable, guests do not complain.",
